  "source_caveat": "The 2017–2022 parent trucking, long-distance truckload and long-distance LTL revenue estimates all originate from two publication vintages of the same 2022 U.S. Census Services Annual Survey; NAICS 484 includes both children and two tax-status rows are not independent replications. Revisions after 2017 reflect a later benchmark/republication context, not observed freight invoices, their prices, billing errors, refund potential or RETALLY market size. Published 2022 source coefficient-of-variation zero does not establish perfect sampling precision or legal recoveries. Nominal growth changes may be affected by price changes and cannot establish real growth without a suitable price index and variance analysis."
